          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Right thumb wart still present, possibly a bit smaller after 4 weeks of salicylic acid paint. No significant pain, discharge, nail deformity, or paraesthesia. New tiny rough spots on the left index periungual area for 1–2 weeks."
